OL,3,GNEWSARoyal British Legion fundraises on
OL,4,APoppy Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal British Legion (RBL) has
OL,7,Flaunched a city-wide fundraising effort
OL,8,Ffor London Poppy Day 2026.
OL,10,FThursday is the 20th anniversary of the
OL,11,Fcharity's annual fundraising event in
OL,12,Fthe capital for the armed forces
OL,13,Fcommunity, and includes performances
OL,14,Ffrom military bands and choirs at more
OL,15,Fthan 20 stations including Waterloo,
OL,16,FLiverpool Street, Euston and London
OL,17,FBridge.
OL,19,FIn 2025, the event raised almost #1.5m
OL,20,Ffor the RBL.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
