OL,3,GNEWSARoyal British Legion fundraises on
OL,4,APoppy Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Inskip, the director of the Poppy
OL,7,FAppeal, said she hoped people would
OL,8,F"get involved, and enjoythe various
OL,9,Fmilitary bands and choirs performing
OL,10,Facross major stations across London -
OL,11,Fand give what they can".
